{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1064268,\"title\":\"Found\",\"tagline\":\"The camera is watching...\",\"overview\":\"Through six vignettes, a broken family confronts their dark past one year after their daughter’s brutal murder was captured on camera in one long take.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a3AkVskeO8lXqs3h4YYNM0uvJpW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":69,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":1800,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Mitchell Stafiej\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1830940,\"name\":\"Mitchell Stafiej\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1302345,\"name\":\"Rebecca Amzallag\",\"character\":\"Julie's Best Friend / Car Crash Victim\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5fpLK5dld3xMuiQ1Q3kWJYSRca2.jpg\"},{\"id\":1691154,\"name\":\"Robert Montcalm\",\"character\":\"The Killer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gDeVQiArFLFKSGmntCNHNuC0fIZ.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":489999,\"title\":\"Searching\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yuAPCsCGJGSxA7YOW4elF5JNrzK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jOqOduY1tLhXgVZo7ypCtDVr0mM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After David Kim's 16-year-old daughter goes missing, a local investigation is opened and a detective is assigned to the case. But 37 hours later and without a single lead, David decides to search the one place no one has looked yet, where all secrets are kept today: his daughter's laptop.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":77016,\"title\":\"End of Watch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pDeVKQICkcdwwjHxGj0MeS14YJ6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wK2D1OAodmCWtaPxybcBFCLRskF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two young officers are marked for death after confiscating a small cache of money and firearms from the members of a notorious cartel during a routine traffic stop.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76726,\"title\":\"Chronicle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kdyrdFIt29FUmLIKvedAc2j4rpo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rgNzvSagnlc32TuMEBa529QFIig.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three high school students make an incredible discovery, leading to their developing uncanny powers beyond their understanding. As they learn to control their abilities and use them to their advantage, their lives start to spin out of control, and their darker sides begin to take over.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":768362,\"title\":\"Missing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wEOUYSU5Uf8J7152PT6jdb5233Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tVH1qEFyKiCpP6kNDFyXKW2Tiif.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When her mother disappears while on vacation in Colombia with her new boyfriend, June’s search for answers is hindered by international red tape. Stuck thousands of miles away in Los Angeles, June creatively uses all the latest technology at her fingertips to try and find her before it’s too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":174772,\"title\":\"Europa Report\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tbsfaBjiAW5vfrV06R8KCOzVOYy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9qngWwy9ijFgpz8JqdadOSgKcWR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A crew travels to Europa, Jupiter’s icy moon, to investigate signs of life in its subsurface ocean, but disaster cuts them off from Earth, leading to a tense and dangerous exploration.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":513434,\"title\":\"One Cut of the Dead\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rws34k2bqYVo2B5MkhKAbV8925j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oslUsPw3PUhDVK7a5soTvCAuaO7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Real zombies arrive and terrorize the crew of a zombie film being shot in an abandoned warehouse, said to be the site of military experiments on humans.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":63197,\"title\":\"Megan Is Missing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lDmIqn0HJDjQJZDZaofuyaAnw2X.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hGTK2dnm1vXYpr26QGWjXIVpI9l.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fourteen-year–old Megan and her best friend Amy spend a lot of time on the internet, posting videos of themselves and chatting with guys online. One night Megan chats with a guy named Josh who convinces her to meet him for a date. The next day, Megan is missing—forever. Based on actual cases of child abduction.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43933,\"title\":\"Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cARETxTELl8kQCIcpbRhEcMjkPD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/imiBIsvNU3TbMB3sbqKanKODS33.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Six years ago NASA discovered the possibility of alien life within our solar system. A probe was launched to collect samples, but crashed upon re-entry over Central America. Soon after, new life forms began to appear and half of Mexico was quarantined as an infected zone. Today, the American and Mexican military still struggle to contain \\\"the creatures,\\\" while a journalist agrees to escort a shaken tourist through the infected zone in Mexico to the safety of the U.S. border.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1140535,\"title\":\"Presence\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xZIGHoHj0DF0zdibwa66cRWHdHO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eT1L3IVcHUL58wLn48E5dxlea3Z.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A couple and their children move into a seemingly normal suburban home. When strange events occur, they begin to believe there is something else in the house with them. The presence is about to disrupt their lives in unimaginable ways.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27090,\"title\":\"Zero Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xFmFNW8Am3QwS4vCpctWkleWbzj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ahXtNFVHtFxvjphZN8QlHRVsu9W.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two troubled adolescents chronicle the events that ultimately lead up to a terrifying assault on their school.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":320048,\"title\":\"Ratter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vSwYyxa12OqcrVnW6qPGqIBFyh2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmwyGjvG2SPox7jVudJXWu1YrQS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Emma is a young and beautiful graduate student just starting a new life in New York City. Like most people her age, she is always connected - her phone and laptop are constant companions, documenting her most intimate moments. What she doesn't realize is that she's sharing her life with an uninvited and dangerous guest. A hacker is following Emma’s every move. When the voyeuristic thrill of watching her digitally isn't enough, the situation escalates to a dangerous and terrifying level.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25218,\"title\":\"Live!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91FAYeluKya14DmtENl8yzzWBv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8esZgBRtP5lY0g0Ui8kLn6rceW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":